James inquired about the deprecation of the `rgdal` package's `readOGR` function for displaying maps in RShiny with Leaflet. I informed him that `rgdal` has been phased out and recommended transitioning to the `sf` package, which integrates spatial data handling in R. I provided step-by-step guidance to replace `readOGR` with `st_read`, noting that `leaflet` works well with `sf` objects. I included code examples to illustrate the conversion, emphasizing that the transition should be straightforward. I assured James of my support for any specific issues he might face during the transition.
